      "level": "avoid",
      "text": {
        "fa": "هشدار جعبه‌ای برچسب درباره کودکان.",
        "en": "Boxed warning in the label about children."
      },
      "quote": "SUICIDALITY AND ANTIDEPRESSANT DRUGS Antidepressants increased the risk of suicidal thoughts and behavior in children, adolescents, and young adults in short-term trials.",
      "refs": [
        {
          "source": "fda-bupropion-xl",
          "section": "Boxed Warning"
        }
      ]
    },
    "geriatric": {
      "level": "caution",
      "text": {
        "fa": "برچسب: در سالمندان با احتیاط و معمولاً از دوز پایین شروع شود.",
        "en": "Label: use with caution in older adults, usually starting at the low end of the dose range."
      },
      "quote": "Because elderly patients are more likely to have decreased renal function, it may be necessary to consider this factor in dose selection; it may be useful to monitor renal function [see Dosage and Administration ( 2.7 ), Use in Specific Populations ( 8.6 ), and Clinical Pharmacology ( 12.3 )] .",
